sections.usage:
```
Create a JSON template for the Obsidian Web Clipper for [COMPANY] in the [INDUSTRY] sector. The template should include fields for [DATA] and [METADATA]. Ensure it follows the Obsidian Web Clipper JSON schema and is ready for import.
```
Copy

```
```json
{
  "title": "[COMPANY] [INDUSTRY] Web Clip Template",
  "fields": [
    {
      "name": "source_url",
      "type": "url",
      "label": "Source URL"
    },
    {
      "name": "clip_date",
      "type": "date",
      "label": "Clip Date"
    },
    {
      "name": "clipper_name",
      "type": "text",
      "label": "Clipper Name"
    },
    {
      "name": "tags",
      "type": "tags",
      "label": "Tags"
    },
    {
      "name": "notes",
      "type": "textarea",
      "label": "Notes"
    }
  ],
  "description": "Standardized web clip template for [COMPANY] in the [INDUSTRY] sector."
}
```
```

